{"3681650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Lavarish Facility", "steam_appid": 3681650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3682490], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/488ff614a4693498e8e1183445f6dc4a.avif?t=1771413033\" width=1560 height=382 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are one of the many Test-Bots built by the facility. They promise you freedom if you experiment with tests related to <i>what is believed</i> to be lava, you must avoid the dangers that come with it though. But the question is..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>can you trust the facility?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>It's all trial and error.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every time you die, you will be able to read reports that explain your death cause created by the facility alongside some statistics. Use these in order to learn how to survive the next time you encounter the death reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Learn about the entities.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Complete challenges or find files around the locations you explore to discover more background to the entities you face and friends you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/06dd959e2f8d8cc04cfd7ab8b9394496.avif?t=1771413033\" width=1560 height=382 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Room Generation</strong>: Every run will be different from the others, whether its when threats spawn or the chambers you must complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun and Unique Puzzles:</strong> Puzzles vary in complexity with some being something as simple as a button push, while others involve much more unique solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Story:</strong> Experience an interesting story unfold as you play through the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Art</strong>: Submit your own art in our Discord server and have it featured in the game on the laptops found everywhere in the facility!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter-Based Narrative:</strong> The game is separated into 5 chapters which introduce new entities, mechanics and interesting elements as the game continues.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/488ff614a4693498e8e1183445f6dc4a.avif?t=1771413033\" width=1560 height=382 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are one of the many Test-Bots built by the facility. They promise you freedom if you experiment with tests related to <i>what is believed</i> to be lava, you must avoid the dangers that come with it though. But the question is..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>can you trust the facility?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>It's all trial and error.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every time you die, you will be able to read reports that explain your death cause created by the facility alongside some statistics. Use these in order to learn how to survive the next time you encounter the death reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Learn about the entities.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Complete challenges or find files around the locations you explore to discover more background to the entities you face and friends you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/06dd959e2f8d8cc04cfd7ab8b9394496.avif?t=1771413033\" width=1560 height=382 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Room Generation</strong>: Every run will be different from the others, whether its when threats spawn or the chambers you must complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun and Unique Puzzles:</strong> Puzzles vary in complexity with some being something as simple as a button push, while others involve much more unique solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Story:</strong> Experience an interesting story unfold as you play through the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Art</strong>: Submit your own art in our Discord server and have it featured in the game on the laptops found everywhere in the facility!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter-Based Narrative:</strong> The game is separated into 5 chapters which introduce new entities, mechanics and interesting elements as the game continues.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A roguelite puzzle game where your only goal is to complete experiments designed for you while avoiding danger. You believe you will earn freedom, but is that really the case?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/8539a9